Fixed Budík palette instead of wallpaper colours, one card per preference
group with 1dp dividers, Instrument Sans / Schibsted Grotesk, letter-spaced
section labels, keycap switch and slider thumb, navy keycap dialog button,
dialog card with a hard shadow, plain back arrow and bold toolbar title.
